<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center">
            <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto">Everything you need to know about .ma domain registration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-item card">
                <h3>Who can register a .ma domain?</h3>
                <p>Any individual or organization, both inside and outside Morocco, can register a .ma domain as long as they comply with the official naming charter set by ANRT.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item card">
                <h3>How long does registration take?</h3>
                <p>Our process is highly optimized. In most cases, if all required information is provided correctly, your .ma domain will be activated instantly or within a few hours.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item card">
                <h3>What is the difference between .ma and .co.ma?</h3>
                <p>.ma is the top-level country code extension, ideal for any entity. .co.ma is specifically designated for commercial enterprises and requires you to provide a Moroccan ICE or RC number during registration.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item card">
                <h3>What documents are needed for verification?</h3>
                <p>For individuals, a valid CIN (National Identity Card) is required. For businesses, the ICE (Identifiant Commun de l'Entreprise) or commercial register details are necessary.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .text-center { text-align: center; }
    .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

    .faq-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-item {
        padding: 2rem;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .faq-item h3::before {
        content: '?';
        background-color: var(--color-primary);
        color: white;
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }

    .faq-item p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        margin: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .faq-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
